2026-09-30T22:05:23.8392451Z 
2026-09-30T22:05:23.8392543Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
2026-09-30T22:05:23.8392706Z 
2026-09-30T22:05:23.8392977Z [32m[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
2026-09-30T22:05:23.8393447Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
2026-09-30T22:05:23.8397507Z 
2026-09-30T22:05:23.8397920Z I will:
2026-09-30T22:05:23.8399746Z 
2026-09-30T22:05:23.8405712Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
2026-09-30T22:05:23.8406518Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
2026-09-30T22:05:23.8407335Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
2026-09-30T22:05:23.8408119Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
2026-09-30T22:05:23.8408674Z  - install Nix in /nix
2026-09-30T22:05:23.8409196Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
2026-09-30T22:05:23.8409931Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
2026-09-30T22:05:23.8410684Z    /root
2026-09-30T22:05:23.8414357Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
2026-09-30T22:05:23.8415409Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
2026-09-30T22:05:23.8426732Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
2026-09-30T22:05:23.8427674Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
2026-09-30T22:05:23.8428238Z 
2026-09-30T22:05:23.8428772Z [32m[4;32mReady to continue?
2026-09-30T22:05:23.8429326Z [0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
2026-09-30T22:05:23.8448029Z 
2026-09-30T22:05:23.8449186Z [34m---- let's talk about sudo -----------------------------------------------------
2026-09-30T22:05:23.8460344Z [0mThis script is going to call sudo a lot. Normally, it would show you
2026-09-30T22:05:23.8461349Z exactly what commands it is running and why. However, the script is
2026-09-30T22:05:23.8462135Z run in a headless fashion, like this:
2026-09-30T22:05:23.8462588Z 
2026-09-30T22:05:23.8463045Z   $ curl -L https://nixos.org/nix/install | sh
2026-09-30T22:05:23.8463438Z 
2026-09-30T22:05:23.8463730Z or maybe in a CI pipeline. Because of that, I'm going to skip the
2026-09-30T22:05:23.8464386Z verbose output in the interest of brevity.
2026-09-30T22:05:23.8464737Z 
2026-09-30T22:05:23.8465128Z If you would like to
2026-09-30T22:05:23.8465516Z see the output, try like this:
2026-09-30T22:05:23.8465817Z 
2026-09-30T22:05:23.8466081Z   $ curl -L -o install-nix https://nixos.org/nix/install
2026-09-30T22:05:23.8466635Z   $ sh ./install-nix
2026-09-30T22:05:23.8466885Z 
